    1. Pick grid H x W where H,W >= 2s+1, s in [1,4]
    2. Assign 4 corners; pick how many are moving (2-4), rest are singletons
    3. Place shifted (output) moving rects at their inward positions (r+s,c+s from corner)
    4. Place singleton rects at their corners (unchanged in output)
    5. Verify no overlap between shifted moving rects and singletons
    6. Build input by moving each moving rect back to its corner and clearing shifted positions
